## 1. Project overview

This document records the source-build process, offline dependency requirements, generated artifacts, runtime configuration and functional verification for EMQX and Apache Kafka.

The objective is to preserve reproducible build environments and make it possible to rebuild and operate both components without internet connectivity.

### Component architecture

```text
IoT Devices
    |
    | MQTT
    v
EMQX Community Edition 5.8.9
    |
    | MQTT messages
    v
Node.js Integration Service
    |
    +----------------------+
    |                      |
    v                      v
Kafka 3.9.2           Direct HTTP
    |                      |
    v                      |
Kafka Consumer              |
    |                      |
    +-----------+----------+
                |
                v
       ThingsBoard CE
          4.3.1.8
                |
                v
         PostgreSQL 16
```

The architecture describes the intended integration. Individual EMQX and Kafka tests do not establish that the complete telemetry pipeline is operational.

